name    mod-kill-collector: only real enemies count (KillCollector.OnlyEnemies)
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Needs KillCollector.Enable = 1, KillCollector.OnlyEnemies = 1
# and this folder in TestBots.ScenarioDirs.
#
# A human mage (an Alliance character of its own, slot 1):
# 1. A Tarren Mill Deathguard (2405, a Horde guard, faction 71, flags_extra GUARD) pays no token and is not
#    collected.
# 2. A Snapjaw (2408, a neutral beast of the Hillsbrad river) still pays a token and is collected.
# The kill (triggered Arcane Explosions, 42921: three for the Snapjaw, nine for the guard's 3696 health) and the respawn-then-pick-again pattern are the ones of
# kill_collector_tokens.
timeout 180s

bot a mage race=human

place 0 -217.3 -1112.8 36.5
require a alive
require a team alliance
do gm target a
as gm .killcollector reset
expect output has "collection reset"
do a destroy 920200

log 1 - a guard of the other team pays nothing
place 0 -160.0 -905.0 55.0
pick g1 creature:2405 near a
do gm target g1
as gm .respawn
wait 6s
pick g1 creature:2405 near a
require g1 alive
do a approach g1
wait 1s
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
waitfor g1 dead timeout 10s
wait 1s
expect a item 920200 == 0
as a .killcollector status
expect output has "0 different creatures killed"

log 2 - a wild beast still pays
place 0 -217.3 -1112.8 36.5
pick t1 creature:2408 near a
do gm target t1
as gm .respawn
wait 6s
pick t1 creature:2408 near a
require t1 alive
do a approach t1
wait 1s
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
waitfor t1 dead timeout 5s
wait 1s
expect a item 920200 == 1
as a .killcollector status
expect output has "1 different creatures killed"

cleanup
do a destroy 920200
log kill collector enemies done
